<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"></head><body style="font-family:sans-serif;color:#0E1116"><p style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600">🔴 payments in shop is crash-looping.</p><h3>What kwatch found</h3><ul><li>The last run of payments-1/app ended OOMKilled, exit code 137.</li><li>Memory climbed from 118Mi to 255Mi in 9 minutes.</li></ul><h3>Log, container app, previous run</h3><pre style="font-family:monospace;background:#F2F3F0;padding:12px;white-space:pre-wrap">cache warm: 41882 entries
cache warm: 96310 entries &lt;@everyone&gt;</pre><h3>Fix (changes the cluster)</h3><p>Raise the memory limit to 384Mi, half again above the observed peak of 255Mi (changes the cluster)</p><pre style="font-family:monospace;background:#F2F3F0;padding:12px;white-space:pre-wrap">kubectl set resources deployment/payments -n shop -c app --limits=memory=384Mi</pre></body></html>
